    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nThis two bedroom mid terraced house has been completely refurbished in recent years and is very well located on Altamount Street, just a short stroll from Westport town centre.\n\nThe property comes to the market in turnkey condition and has a floor area of approximately 72.5 sq m/780sq ft. Ground floor accommodation consists of an entrance hall, living room with a solid fuel stove and back boiler, a large kitchen/diner and a utility room,. On the second floor there are two double bedrooms (one with en-suite and walk in wardrobe), a recently refurbished shower room and hotpress. There is potential, subject to planning permission, for additional accommodation in the attic area.\n\nExternally, there is a small courtyard to the rear of the property with a recently installed fully slated Lean-to which offers excellent storage space, and a small garden to the front.\n\nWith its convenient location, this property would make an ideal first time buyer's home or suit someone looking to downsize close to town. Alternatively it could make a good investment with potential for long or short term letting. This property is within a few minutes' walk of Westport's many amenities including schools, shops, leisure centre with cinema and swimming pool, bars and restaurants."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nEntrance Hall - 4.28m x 1.1m\nItalian tiled floor, new composite door, carpeted staircase\n\nLiving Room - 3.83m x 3.25m & 2.18m x 0.7m\nEngineered oak laminate floor, fireplace with solid fuel stove (back boiler), large bay window, frosted glass door to hall, curtains\n\nKitchen/Diner - 5.05m x 3.12m\nTiled floor & splashback, buttermilk ivory kitchen, integrated oven/hob, fridge freezer, (plumber for dishwasher), door to courtyard, curtains\n\nUtility Room - 2.2m x 0.89m\nPlumbed for washing machine\n\nFirst Floor landing - 1.98m x 1.82m\nCarpeted, stira with stairwell\n\nBedroom One - 4.04m x 3.28m & 2.18m x 0.7m\nEngineered oak laminate floor, large bay window, curtains\n\nEn-Suite - 2.41m x 0.87m\nFully tiled, electric shower, wc, whb\n\nWalk in Wardrobe - \nShelved\n\nBedroom Two - 2.97m x 3.16m\nEngineered oak laminate floor, built in wardrobes, curtains\n\nBathroom - 1.97m x 1.66m & 0.89m x 0.53m\nFully tiled, power shower, built in cupboard, wc, whb\n\nHotpress - 0.97m x 0.43m\nImmersion heater with timer\n\n"
      },
